 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/asahi_m4.rs    |  4 ++
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs | 90 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

